<input placeholder="Cargo" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 focus:border-primary transition" type="text" value="Practicante">
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
<button type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border text-[12px] font-medium transition-all active:scale-95 bg-primary text-white border-primary">Sector público</button>
<button type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border text-[12px] font-medium transition-all active:scale-95 border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 bg-white hover:border-primary">Empresa privada</button>
<button type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border text-[12px] font-medium transition-all active:scale-95 border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 bg-white hover:border-primary">ONG / cooperación</button>
<button type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border text-[12px] font-medium transition-all active:scale-95 border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 bg-white hover:border-primary">Universidad / investigación</button>
<button type="button" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border text-[12px] font-medium transition-all active:scale-95 border-neutral-200 text-neutral-600 bg-white hover:border-primary">Negocio propio</button>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 items-center">
<input aria-label="Desde" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 focus:border-primary transition" type="month" value="2019-01">
<input aria-label="Hasta" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 focus:border-primary transition disabled:opacity-40" type="month" value="2020-12">
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-neutral-700 col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
<input class="accent-primary" type="checkbox">Trabajo aquí actualmente</label>
</div>
<textarea rows="2" placeholder="Qué hacías: funciones, responsabilidades, logros…" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 focus:border-primary transition resize-y">
</textarea>
<label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-neutral-700">
<input class="accent-primary" type="checkbox">Este puesto tiene que ver con el máster que busco</label>
</div>
<button type="button" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-neutral-300 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-600 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-all active:scale-[0.99]">+ Añadir otro puesto</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-5 pt-5 border-t border-neutral-100">
<p class="ex-sub">Investigación y formación</p>
<div class="space-y-6">
<div>
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-3">¿Tienes experiencia en investigación?<span class="text-red-400 ml-0.5">*</span>
</p>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 ">
<button type="button" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-sm font-medium transition-all active:scale-[0.99] bg-primary text-white border-primary shadow-sm">
<span class="float-right opacity-70">✓</span>Sí, tengo publicaciones o grupos de investigación</button>
<button type="button" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-sm font-medium transition-all active:scale-[0.99] border-neutral-200 text-neutral-700 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary bg-white">No tengo experiencia en investigación</button>
</div>
<textarea rows="2" class="mt-3 w-full rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 px-3.5 py-3 text-sm resize-y focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 transition" placeholder="Publicaciones, grupos de investigación, proyectos…">Grupo de investigación en derecho ambiental</textarea>
</div>
<div>
<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-800 mb-3">Formación complementaria relacionada con el máster<span class="text-red-400 ml-0.5">*</span>
</p>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 ">
<button type="button" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border text-sm font-medium transition-all active:scale-[0.99] bg-primary text-white border-primary shadow-sm">
